exports[`UI regression > Projects copy is unchanged 1`] = `"// selected workThings I've built that actually run.Agents, RAG, fine-tuned models — from enterprise CI/CD to a live food-scanning app.● Live on Hugging FaceFood Health ScannerSnap a photo of any food or type a product name — six cooperating agents (vision, search, nutrition, verification, benefits, pros/cons) find nutrition evidence, verify it, and return gauges, a 1–5 star rating and a downloadable PDF/HTML report.Self-verifying agent loop that retries with refined queries when evidence is weakChromaDB vector memory (MiniLM embeddings) reuses past analyses — RAG on its own historyGradio UI + private Node.js API, shipped as a Docker SpaceTry it live Source 🥗📷 Vision🔎 Search🧪 Nutrition✅ Verify💚 Benefits⚖️ Pros/ConsEnterprise · Accenture × DellGenAI DevOps Assistant for DellAn internal developer assistant for Dell's iDRAC firmware release team: RAG over Confluence docs and Jenkins pipeline logs, plus CrewAI agents that analyse build failures and point engineers to the root cause.▹RAG over Confluence + Jenkins logs for instant CI/CD failure debugging▹CrewAI agents for root-cause detection; OpenAI SDK automation for Build Verification Testing▹Built on top of Jenkins pipelines serving Dell 15G, 16G and 17G servers, monitored with Prometheus & GrafanaRAGCrewAIOpenAI SDKJenkinsPrometheusGrafana86% ensemble accuracyHybrid LLM + ML Price PredictorPredicts Amazon product prices from metadata and descriptions by blending a QLoRA-fine-tuned LLaMA 3.2 1B, a fine-tuned OpenAI model, Random Forest and XGBoost — stacked with a linear-regression meta-model.▹QLoRA fine-tune of LLaMA 3.2 1B hit 85% on its own▹Weighted ensemble (70/15/10/5) lifted accuracy to 86%▹Gradio UI with Pushover mobile alertsQLoRALLaMA 3.2XGBoostHuggingFaceGradioAgents that ship codeAI Engineering Team (CrewAI)A simulated software team of four role-based agents — Project Manager, Backend Engineer, QA Tester and Frontend Developer — that turns a plain-English requirement into a tested Python app with a Gradio UI.▹PM agent breaks down requirements and writes the prompts for the rest of the crew▹QA agent tests module-by-module and feeds issues back for another pass▹Fully automated: requirement → code → tests → UICrewAIAgentic AIPythonGradio"`;

exports[`UI regression > Services copy is unchanged 1`] = `"// what I can automate for youI can automate your tasks with AI.You get your hours back.If someone on your team does it every day by copy-paste, it can probably be automated. Here's where I usually start.AI Customer SupportA 24/7 assistant that answers your customers from your own FAQs, catalogue and policies — on WhatsApp, web or email.Document & Data AutomationInvoices, forms and PDFs read by AI and pushed straight into Excel, Sheets or your CRM. No more copy-paste.Multi-Agent WorkflowsTeams of specialised AI agents (CrewAI / OpenAI Agents) that research, write, check and act — end to end.Private Knowledge AssistantsRAG over your SOPs, Confluence and Drive. Your team asks, the AI answers — with sources.Prediction & ForecastingHybrid ML + fine-tuned LLM models for pricing, demand and scoring — built for your data.AI for DevOpsLog-triage agents that read CI/CD failures, find the root cause and suggest the fix.Not sure what fits? Chat with my AI assistant"`;
